menu "P4Key credential proof"

config P4KEY_CRED_REBOOT_TEST
    bool "Run wrapped credential reboot proof"
    default n
    help
        Create wrap and open one test credential then perform one software
        reboot and open the same opaque credential ID again. No credential
        or private material is logged. Restore normal firmware after the
        result is captured and keep this disabled in normal firmware.

endmenu
